<title>USA: Gabelli group cuts Fieldcrest stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group cuts Fieldcrest stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Thursday it cut its stake in Fieldcrest Cannon Inc to 1,119,364 common shares or 10.9 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include net sales of 16,800 common shares sold between August 5 and September 30 at prices ranging from $13.75 to $18 per share.</p>
<p>The group had been holding the shares for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
